<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62773" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>whiten over</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυξίον</span>]
				<i><span class="en">
				Aen.Tact.
				31.14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βωμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1672.140
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκοῦσθαι τὰ ὅπλα</span>
			<i>whiten their</i> shields, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				2.4.25
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				7.5.20
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. πόδα</span>
			<i>bare</i> the foot, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.403
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Maec.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> mostly in 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be made</i> or <i>become white</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκωθεὶς κάρα μύρτοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>I.</u>
					4(3).69
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖχος λελευκωμένος</span>
			<i>whitened</i> or <i>plastered</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				785a
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γραμματεῖον λελευκωμένον,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεύκωμα</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				46.11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἄνθρωπος οὐ λευκός ἐστιν ἀλλὰ
					λελεύκωται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					185b29
				</span></i>
			; of a leper, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.346
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λελευκωμένος πίναξ</span>, of
			the list of proscribed, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				109.12
			</span></i>.</div>
